SUMMARY:Ran
DTSTART:20250807T020000Z
DTEND:20250807T050500Z
DTSTAMP:20250807T020000Z
UID:ctpmaTvmPu
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 162 mins (2h42m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective 
 Akira Kurosawa’s favorite of his films\, this innovative\, epic adaptati
 on of “King Lear”—nominated for four Academy Awards including Best D
 irector—returns to the giant screen. New 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/programs-and-events/akira-kurosawa-retrospective/ran
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
