BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pee-wee’s Big Adventure
DTSTART:20250809T194500Z
DTEND:20250809T213500Z
DTSTAMP:20250809T194500Z
UID:LqG97VkNov
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nSliding Scale Community Screening
 s Celebrate the 40th anniversary of Tim Burton's comic masterpiece Pee-wee
 's Big Adventure at SIFF Cinema Downtown. In appreciation of our movie-lov
 ing community\, tickets to this screening are available on a sliding scale
  basis\, starting at $5 for child tickets. Enjoy the film for less or give
  more generously to support nonprofit movie magic.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net
 /programs-and-events/sliding-scale-community-screenings/pee-wees-big-adven
 ture
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
