 A bad day gets worse for young detective Murakami when a pickpocket steals
  his gun on a hot\, crowded bus. This early classic goes beyond a crime th
 riller\, probing the squalid world of postwar Japan and the nature of the 
 criminal mind. New 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-ev
 ents/akira-kurosawa-retrospective/stray-dog
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
