 rs of Jaws with this new 4K restoration\, with four screenings presented i
 n 3D. No OCAP for the 6:15pm 3D screening on August 31 3D screenings:Frida
 y\, August 29 - 3:00pmSaturday\, August 30 - 9:30pmSunday\, August 31 - 6:
